From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: IamMaxim <g.maxim.stepanoff@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 28 May 2026 22:31:49 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] strip: remove channel crate + Channel match in file_finder

Removes the cloud channels integration:
 - Delete crates/channel (ChannelStore + ChannelBuffer + channel chat
   + Notes RPC client).
 - workspace: drop OpenChannelNotesById action.
 - file_finder: drop the Match::Channel variant, channel_store field,
   StringMatchCandidate scoring loop, channel-search code path, render
   icon arm, and OpenChannelNotesById dispatch.
 - open_path_prompt: drop the include_channels FileFinderSettings field
   (the underlying settings_content field stays as an inert no-op
   to avoid a settings migration).
 - zed: drop channel::init from main.rs and the visual-test init,
   plus the channel workspace dep on title_bar (unused after the
   collab strip) and file_finder.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
